# translations for aliases
#: puavo-laptop-setup:29
msgid "latest"
msgstr "senaste"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:29
msgid "stable"
msgstr "stabil"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:29
msgid "penultimate"
msgstr "näst senaste"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:29
msgid "test"
msgstr "test"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:294
msgid "and"
msgstr "och"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:376
msgid ""
"It is now possible to choose Windows from the boot menu when starting up the "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"Windows har nu tilläggats till startmenun. Menun syns alltid när man startar "
"om datorn."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:380
msgid ""
"Abitti 2 is not updated when running Windows, you have to boot into the "
"current system to update it."
msgstr ""
"Obs! Abitti 2 uppdateras inte när datorn har startats till Windows. För att "
"byta / uppdatera din laptops Abitti 2 måste man välja normal start och välja "
"det här Opinsys Os som används nu."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:531
msgid "error saving changes"
msgstr "fel i sparning av ändringarna "

#: puavo-laptop-setup:566
msgid "Factory reset is running step"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning kör steg"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:579
msgid "Factory reset is running"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning pågår"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:587
msgid "Failed to start factory reset"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningen kunde inte börjas"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:590 puavo-laptop-setup:621
msgid "Factory reset failed"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningen mislyckades"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:608
msgid "Factory reset succeeded."
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningen lyckades."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:610
msgid "The system is going to reboot in few seconds..."
msgstr "Systemet startar om i några sekunder..."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:623
msgid ""
"Further details can be found from the factory reset log. Please contact "
"support for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare detaljer kan hittas från fabriksåterställningsloggen. Kontakta "
"supporten för hjälp."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:717
msgid "Failed to set the keymap"
msgstr "Misslyckades att ställa in tangentbordslayouten"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:730
msgid "Change PIN on next boot?"
msgstr "Ändra PIN-kod vid nästa start?"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:734
msgid ""
"The disk encryption PIN can only be changed during boot. A PIN change "
"request will be stored and the system will prompt you to set a new PIN on "
"the next boot."
msgstr ""
"Diskkrypteringens PIN-kod kan bara ändras vid uppstart. En begäran om PIN-"
"ändring sparas och systemet uppmanar dig att ange en ny PIN-kod vid nästa "
"start."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:741 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:487
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Avbryt"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:742
msgid "Request PIN change"
msgstr "Begär PIN-ändring"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:743
msgid "Request and reboot now"
msgstr "Begär och starta om nu"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:752
msgid "Failed to request PIN change"
msgstr "Misslyckades att begära PIN-ändring"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:766
msgid "PIN change requested"
msgstr "PIN-ändring begärd"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:769
msgid "You will be prompted to change the PIN on the next boot."
msgstr "Du kommer att uppmanas att ändra PIN-koden vid nästa start."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:810
msgid "Failed to load recovery data"
msgstr "Misslyckades att ladda återställningsdata"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:882 puavo-laptop-setup:948
msgid "Laptop setup"
msgstr "Laptop inställningar"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:938
msgid "You do not have the required permissions to use this tool."
msgstr "Du har inte tillräckliga rättigheter att använda verktyget."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:948
msgid "is already running"
msgstr "är redan igång"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:20 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:31
msgid "Abitti 2 version"
msgstr "Abitti 2-version"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:42
msgid "Show developer mode in boot menu"
msgstr "Visa utvecklarläge i startmenyn"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:53
msgid "Default operating system at boot"
msgstr "Standardoperativsystem i starten"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:67
msgid "school versions"
msgstr "skolversioner"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:94
msgid "flexible version"
msgstr "flexibel version"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:119
msgid "this version"
msgstr "den här versionen"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:164 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:536
msgid "Puavo OS (Linux)"
msgstr "Puavo OS (Linux)"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:180
msgid "Abitti 2"
msgstr "Abitti 2"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:196 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:552
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

# from puavo-laptop-setup.glade
#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:232
msgid "Start using Windows"
msgstr "Aktivera Windows"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:251
msgid "Factory reset..."
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning..."

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:263
msgid "Disk encryption..."
msgstr "Diskkryptering..."

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:288
msgid "Disk encryption"
msgstr "Diskkryptering"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:304 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:426
#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:602
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Stäng"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:339
msgid "Show recovery QR code"
msgstr "Visa diskåterställnings-QR-kod"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:352
msgid "Change PIN on next boot..."
msgstr "Ändra PIN-kod vid nästa start..."

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:370
msgid "Keymap at unlock"
msgstr "Tangentbordslayout vid upplåsning"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:410
msgid "Recovery QR code"
msgstr "Diskåterställnings-QR-kod"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:469
msgid "Confirmation of factory reset"
msgstr "Bekräftelse på fabriksåterställning"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:503
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Återställa"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:526
msgid "Select operating systems to reset:"
msgstr "Välj operativsystem som ska återställas:"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:572
msgid ""
"<big>Factory reset <span foreground=\"red\" size=\"x-large\">erases all user "
"data</span> from selected operating systems and restores their state to "
"factory settings!</big>"
msgstr ""
"<big>Fabriksåterställning <span foreground=\"red\" size=\"x-large\"> raderar "
"all användardata</span> från valda operativsystem och återställer deras "
"tillstånd till fabriksinställningarna!</big>"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:587
msgid "Factory reset"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:647
msgid "Factory reset log"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningslogg"
